2. Dependencies
---------------

These are required to build or run Rhea but are not distributed with it, so no
notice is required; they are listed so that anyone redistributing a built
artifact knows what is in it. All are compatible with the GPLv3 that Rhea uses.

  e3nn          MIT                            (also see section 1)
  PyTorch       BSD-3-Clause                   python training and LibTorch
  Kokkos >= 4.0 Apache-2.0 with LLVM exception cpp_interface/kokkos/
  NumPy         BSD-3-Clause
  SciPy         BSD-3-Clause                   Lebedev quadrature in box3d.py
  h5py          BSD-3-Clause                   training databases
  SymPy         BSD-3-Clause
  Matplotlib    PSF-based (matplotlib license)  plotting only
  Syne Tune     Apache-2.0                     hyperparameter search

The pinned versions are in the Dockerfile.
